  "details": "# Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Launch VRChat in VR mode\n\n2. Use a taller than average avatar\n\n3. Deploy a drone\n\n4. Enable drone FPV\n\n5. Switch to a shorter than average avatar\n\n6. Enable drone FPV once again\n\n# Actual result:\n\nThe FPV screen scales differently depending on the size of your avatar. The largest possible scaling option in the drone's settings is still very small for short avatars.\n\n# Expected result:\n\nThe drone FPV screen should be the same size regardless of what avatar the player is using.",
